    "text": "Let the equation of the pair of lines, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;can be written as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then the equation of the pair of the angle bisectors of the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is:"
